WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.780
- And now details on the sudden announcement that has captured the attention of the entire world.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.960
Hidden among the countless billions of Wonka bars are five gold tickets,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.820
